00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:50.300
So it's a sentient being.

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:51.560
It's, it's learning.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:52.960
Yeah. Yeah, exactly.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:53.920
Even scarier.

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:56.180
Yeah. It gets scarier by the moment.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:57.640
I was, I am surprised.

00:08:57.880 --> 00:09:00.720
Well, also, I'm also watching a playthrough right now, which I'm sure you are.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:16.740
I didn't know this strategy of making these tiny little, little boxes of the, like 2%, 2%, 2%, 2% until you're able to suddenly block off kicks and then like fill off like, but, you know, suddenly another 80% of the screen at once.

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:18.340
Until I'm watching this guy.

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:20.100
This is, this is definitely the way to do it.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:25.480
I was, I was, I was, I was taking all kinds of risks that were sometimes paying off and sometimes getting me killed.

