00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.820
Because like, sometimes you're not just making a little box.

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:25.400
Sometimes you're dividing the whole screen or you're making this crazy geometric shape that goes from like the top left corner to like halfway down the bottom right area.

